<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - November 15.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - November 15.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day  and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 3139.02, 28.79 points or 0.93 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
